# CODEOWNERS
#
# Every change needs platform-team review. The path rules below document
# review intent for high-blast-radius and security-sensitive roots; they are
# enforced once the branch ruleset requires code-owner review
# (github/repo-management, var.require_code_owner_review).
#
# scripts/init-template.sh replaces @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team with the
# owner you pass. Point the narrower paths at dedicated teams (e.g.
# platform-leads, security) once they exist.

# Default: everything.
*                                   @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team

# High blast radius: the org itself, SCPs, production, CI, repo settings.
/aws/organization/                  @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/aws/policies/                      @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/aws/bootstrap/                     @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/aws/accounts/management/           @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/aws/accounts/production/           @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/azure/bootstrap/                   @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/azure/production/                  @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/github/                            @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/.github/                           @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/scripts/                           @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team

# Security- and identity-sensitive roots and guardrail config.
/aws/accounts/*/github-oidc/        @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/aws/accounts/*/hardening/          @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/.pre-commit-config.yaml            @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/.trivyignore                       @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
/.claude/                           @YOUR_GITHUB_ORG/platform-team
